    {
      "id": 4,
      "kind": "mother_usage",
      "payload": "{\"model_calls\":1,\"phase\":\"preparation\",\"plan\":{\"A\":\"Develop a low-risk copy/allocation optimization while preserving control flow. Pass immutable graphs, matrices, vectors and constraint lists by const reference, especially in Prim_ST, find_min_key, is_cycle, coresConjunto and DFS calls. Leave mutable DFS-history ownership unchanged in this tree. Bulk-initialize storage and reserve input-sized scratch space. Replace the scan for the last partition with moving partitions.back() into a local object and pop_back(), preserving LIFO order. Avoid references into partitions across operations that can reallocate it. Measure incremental variants using the unchanged harness; retain exact comparisons, traversal order and output formatting.\",\"B\":\"Optimize caminhoTropi/deep without changing spanning-tree enumeration. Build tree adjacency once per spanning tree by appending endpoints in the existing edge-list order; sorting these neighbor lists can change the answer. Use one push/pop path, constant-time vertex membership and rollback-safe color frequencies with an incremental distinct-color count. Copy paths only for incumbent updates or output. Preserve ascending starting vertices, neighbor order, leaf-only evaluation, immediate return on the first full-color leaf and strict greater-than incumbent updates across trees. Support arbitrary valid color counts with dynamic or compressed storage. Investigate sound upper-bound pruning separately: skip only branches unable to improve the incumbent, and never print an internal path merely because it already contains all colors.\",\"C\":\"Target Prim_ST work elimination. First investigate removing mat_cycle and is_cycle with an equivalence proof: persistent writes require parent[u] > 0, so row 0 remains empty; root 0 is processed first, when each temporary outgoing edge is alone and then restored. Consequently these cycle checks cannot reject a candidate in this implementation. Next compare an optimized dense implementation against immutable, ascending-neighbor adjacency with exclusion marks and a minimum-vertex-ID frontier. All usable edges have weight one, so each accepted vertex receives its parent at first discovery. Preserve ascending neighbor processing because include guards inspect parent assignments made during the scan. Preserve include-map overwrite order, sentinel 100, disconnected outcomes, child-index ordering of spanning edges and partition processing order. Do not substitute conventional constrained Prim/Kruskal semantics. Benchmark these stages independently before combining them.\",\"G\":\"Integrate only validated programs from A/B/C, retaining the baseline and best standalone candidates. Test staged combinations and measure the actual integrated executable against its constituent candidates; gains are not additive. Preserve exact witness, count, formatting, traversal ties, partition order and constraint behavior. Review rollback correctness, moved-object lifetimes, disconnected/singleton graphs, unused colors and deep paths. Audit the included_edges[j] bounds and sentinel behavior rather than relying on undefined reads or undocumented limits. Four passing cases are not a proof for every valid input. Use only the existing validation and measurement facilities within unchanged budgets; do not change tests, oracle, compiler, target or permissions. Reject noisy or regressing integrations and retain the fastest demonstrably correct candidate.\",\"analysis\":\"Only Problem A's tropical.cpp is supplied; A/B/C are research roles, not the other contest problems. The baseline passes four correctness cases and averages 7.461 ms, with samples spanning 7.409–7.504 ms. No profiles or candidate measurements establish a bottleneck. Source-level opportunities include repeated quadratic graph copies, DFS edge rescanning and color recounting, matrix-heavy Prim calls and partition copying. Prioritize serial work elimination on the four-core ARM64 target: at this runtime, threading overhead may outweigh benefits. Because comparison is against the sequential output, preserving the deterministic path witness matters, not merely returning the same color count.\"},\"request_sha256\":\"64e50df98bd7bb83681e068ec1ec2cd5a7362fc17033b4181f24014aafa8aea0\",\"response\":{\"data\":{\"A\":\"Develop a low-risk copy/allocation optimization while preserving control flow. Pass immutable graphs, matrices, vectors and constraint lists by const reference, especially in Prim_ST, find_min_key, is_cycle, coresConjunto and DFS calls. Leave mutable DFS-history ownership unchanged in this tree. Bulk-initialize storage and reserve input-sized scratch space. Replace the scan for the last partition with moving partitions.back() into a local object and pop_back(), preserving LIFO order. Avoid references into partitions across operations that can reallocate it. Measure incremental variants using the unchanged harness; retain exact comparisons, traversal order and output formatting.\",\"B\":\"Optimize caminhoTropi/deep without changing spanning-tree enumeration. Build tree adjacency once per spanning tree by appending endpoints in the existing edge-list order; sorting these neighbor lists can change the answer. Use one push/pop path, constant-time vertex membership and rollback-safe color frequencies with an incremental distinct-color count. Copy paths only for incumbent updates or output. Preserve ascending starting vertices, neighbor order, leaf-only evaluation, immediate return on the first full-color leaf and strict greater-than incumbent updates across trees. Support arbitrary valid color counts with dynamic or compressed storage. Investigate sound upper-bound pruning separately: skip only branches unable to improve the incumbent, and never print an internal path merely because it already contains all colors.\",\"C\":\"Target Prim_ST work elimination. First investigate removing mat_cycle and is_cycle with an equivalence proof: persistent writes require parent[u] > 0, so row 0 remains empty; root 0 is processed first, when each temporary outgoing edge is alone and then restored. Consequently these cycle checks cannot reject a candidate in this implementation. Next compare an optimized dense implementation against immutable, ascending-neighbor adjacency with exclusion marks and a minimum-vertex-ID frontier. All usable edges have weight one, so each accepted vertex receives its parent at first discovery. Preserve ascending neighbor processing because include guards inspect parent assignments made during the scan. Preserve include-map overwrite order, sentinel 100, disconnected outcomes, child-index ordering of spanning edges and partition processing order. Do not substitute conventional constrained Prim/Kruskal semantics. Benchmark these stages independently before combining them.\",\"G\":\"Integrate only validated programs from A/B/C, retaining the baseline and best standalone candidates. Test staged combinations and measure the actual integrated executable against its constituent candidates; gains are not additive. Preserve exact witness, count, formatting, traversal ties, partition order and constraint behavior. Review rollback correctness, moved-object lifetimes, disconnected/singleton graphs, unused colors and deep paths. Audit the included_edges[j] bounds and sentinel behavior rather than relying on undefined reads or undocumented limits. Four passing cases are not a proof for every valid input. Use only the existing validation and measurement facilities within unchanged budgets; do not change tests, oracle, compiler, target or permissions. Reject noisy or regressing integrations and retain the fastest demonstrably correct candidate.\",\"analysis\":\"Only Problem A's tropical.cpp is supplied; A/B/C are research roles, not the other contest problems. The baseline passes four correctness cases and averages 7.461 ms, with samples spanning 7.409–7.504 ms. No profiles or candidate measurements establish a bottleneck. Source-level opportunities include repeated quadratic graph copies, DFS edge rescanning and color recounting, matrix-heavy Prim calls and partition copying. Prioritize serial work elimination on the four-core ARM64 target: at this runtime, threading overhead may outweigh benefits. Because comparison is against the sequential output, preserving the deterministic path witness matters, not merely returning the same color count.\"},\"error\":null,\"infrastructure_error\":false,\"model\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"nonce\":\"94e0f3c936aa4efda7706249d75b9f5e\",\"protocol\":\"hpc-forest-codex-mailbox-v1\",\"reasoning_effort\":\"max\",\"request_sha256\":\"64e50df98bd7bb83681e068ec1ec2cd5a7362fc17033b4181f24014aafa8aea0\",\"session_id\":\"aa970cf8bf5d4c1aaa0fdabb21d73a72\",\"usage\":{\"cached_tokens_included_in_input\":true,\"codex_jsonl_sha256\":\"e771a6fc3423c7cb18c962718723668a8b7868ba261705e078bac73a5ca40ee8\",\"events\":[{\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"cached_input_tokens\":0,\"input_tokens\":14742,\"output_tokens\":8829,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":8081}],\"llm_calls\":1,\"model_requested\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"reasoning_effort_requested\":\"max\",\"token_accounting\":\"exact\",\"tokens\":23571,\"tool_events\":[]}},\"status\":\"complete\"}",
